{"about_the_game":"Deep down in the Earth, Demonic Temples await you. The countdown will begin as you make your way in search of the only hope your daughter has for recovery.<br>She has fallen gravely sick and the villagers all say that her only chance is an elixir found somewhere in the deepest temples underground.<br>A home to demons and other unknown horrific monsters, these \u201cDemonic Temples\u201d can only be accessed through a dead volcano.<br>You must first navigate through an intricate cave system, developing yourself and your skills as you go.<br>Unknown dangers are sure to already be awaiting you there. Use the resources of your village to help you on your mission. <br>Shop at the stores, visit the school or the bank. They all have something to offer. <br>You will need all of the resources that you can find to successfully explore past the caves and reach the medicine down below. <br>The Demonic Temples will have no mercy, so prepare yourself on the way.<br><br><strong>99 Levels of difficulty</strong><br>And there is new stuff to find on every difficulty.<br><br><strong>Randomized Caves</strong><br>Each time you play will be different.<br><br><strong>Prebuilt Caves</strong><br>More than 100 prebuilt caves.<br><br><strong>Global leaderboards</strong><br>Compete against everyone else playing this game or compete with your friends.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Consolation Award","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/360030/eaf441e7ba3c9c6fa8119d538aa671663cbed3f1.jpg"},{"name":"Bronce Medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/360030/9a4c203f582ea3ae8e3fb213ccefce5e42342f0c.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/360030/3e0ef7ff18ac4cc69ac16effa4aa09c9420809d9.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Medal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/360030/2279f293465796f2fa65ab0911610bcb